{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>My people</b> — And the sign that they are without heart is that <b>my people</b> recurs to inquire of its stock, which is the idol." "<b>For a spirit of harlotry has led astray</b> — it [the spirit]." "<b>And they commit harlotry</b> — all of them [are] beneath Elohim, as he mentioned <b>my people</b>."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:05.912013766Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}